{"seq":20,"slug":"complex-analysis","title":"复分析","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis","rating":{"composite":3.6,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"复分析\">复分析</h1><p>把虚数单位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 请进数系，平面上的点就有了乘除，旋转变成乘法，二维场获得了微积分。复分析正是研究「在复平面上可导的函数」的学科，而它最反复出现的主题只有一句话：复可导是一种极强的约束，强到一旦成立，奇迹就接踵而至——函数自动无穷可导、自动展成幂级数、积分自动只看端点、值被边界完全锁死。本 hub 用四章把这串奇迹按因果顺序铺开，每一章都是上一章的直接延伸，而非孤立的知识点堆叠。</p>\n<p>第一章「复数与复函数」打地基。先把复数当作复平面上能相乘的点，建立模、辐角、极形式这套几何直觉；再引入复变函数与那个「方向无限自由」的极限，导出全书的总开关——柯西-黎曼方程。正是这条方程定义了「解析」，并预告了实部虚部都是调和函数这一通往物理应用的暗道。</p>\n<p>第二章「复积分」把解析性翻译成积分语言。从围道积分的定义与那个奠基常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∮</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint\\frac{dz}{z}=2\\pi i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∮</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 出发，推出柯西积分定理（解析区域内绕圈积分为零），再到柯西积分公式（边界值决定内部一切）——后者还顺手证明了解析即无穷可导、Liouville 定理与代数基本定理。</p>\n<p>第三章「级数与留数」把积分变成代数。解析函数必然展成泰勒级数，带奇点时则用洛朗级数，而展开里幸存的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是留数。留数定理由此把复杂围道积分化为「数奇点、加留数、乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>」，并反过来攻克大量实变量算不出的实积分。</p>\n<p>第四章「映射与应用」把全部工具对准现实。共形映射利用「解析即局部缩放加旋转」保角，把怪区域掰成圆盘求解；解析延拓利用解析函数的刚性把局部缝成整体，引出黎曼 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\zeta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span></span></span></span></span> 函数与千禧难题；最后落到流体、静电、信号、量子等真实战场，看复势与留数如何撑起二维稳态场和复频域分析。</p>\n<p>四章一以贯之：复函数定义解析性，复积分把解析性变成可算的等式，级数与留数把等式提炼成留数代数，映射与应用再把这套代数还给世界。读者建议顺章而下，因为每一步的「为什么」都藏在前一步里。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"复数与复函数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"complex-numbers-plane","title":"复数与复平面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/foundations/complex-numbers-plane"},{"seq":2,"slug":"complex-functions-limits","title":"复变函数与极限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/foundations/complex-functions-limits"},{"seq":3,"slug":"analytic-cr-equations","title":"解析函数与柯西-黎曼方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/foundations/analytic-cr-equations"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"integration","title":"复积分","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contour-integration","title":"复积分与路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/integration/contour-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cauchy-theorem","title":"柯西积分定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/integration/cauchy-theorem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cauchy-formula","title":"柯西积分公式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/integration/cauchy-formula"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"series-residues","title":"级数与留数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/series-residues","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"taylor-laurent","title":"泰勒与洛朗级数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/series-residues/taylor-laurent"},{"seq":2,"slug":"singularities-residues","title":"奇点与留数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/series-residues/singularities-residues"},{"seq":3,"slug":"residue-theorem","title":"留数定理与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/series-residues/residue-theorem"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"mapping","title":"映射与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/mapping","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conformal-mapping","title":"共形映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/mapping/conformal-mapping"},{"seq":2,"slug":"analytic-continuation","title":"解析延拓","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/mapping/analytic-continuation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"physics-engineering","title":"物理与工程应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/complex-analysis/mapping/physics-engineering"}]}]}